---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import ConsultationForm from '../components/sections/ConsultationForm.astro';
import ParticleBackground from '../components/ParticleBackground.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us - Cucaracha - Professional Pest & Rodent Control" description="Learn about Cucaracha - Leading pest extermination and disinfection service with over 9 years of excellence and 11,000+ satisfied clients.">
  <ParticleBackground />
  <Header />
  
  <main class="pt-32 pb-16 relative z-10">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <!-- Breadcrumbs -->
      <nav class="flex text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mb-8 font-medium">
        <ol class="flex items-center space-x-2">
          <li>
            <a href="/" class="hover:text-[var(--color-accent-primary)] transition-colors">Home</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="mx-2">/</span>
          </li>
          <li class="text-[var(--color-text-main)]">
            About Us
          </li>
        </ol>
      </nav>

      <div class="glass-panel p-8 md:p-12 rounded-3xl shadow-xl">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black mb-8 text-[var(--color-text-main)] tracking-tight leading-tight">
          About <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[var(--color-accent-primary)] to-[#5c4cdb]">Us</span>
        </h1>
        
        <div class="prose prose-lg prose-headings:font-bold prose-headings:text-[var(--color-text-main)] prose-p:text-[var(--color-text-muted)] max-w-none">
          <p class="text-xl font-medium text-[var(--color-text-main)] mb-8">
            <strong>Cucaracha</strong> – guaranteed comfort and safety on your premises, completely free of pests and rodents!
          </p>

          <p class="mb-6">
            Since 2015, Cucaracha has specialized in professional pest elimination and rodent control. We utilize the most advanced pest management methodologies on the market. We exclusively employ certified, hypoallergenic products from leading European manufacturers that are fully safe for children and domestic animals, delivering the highest quality-to-price ratio for over 9 years.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl mt-12 mb-6">Our Core Service Areas:</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-4 mb-8">
            <li><span><strong>Pest Control (Disinsection)</strong> — extermination of cockroaches, bed bugs, fleas, ticks, and over 15 other insect species.</span></li>
            <li><span><strong>Rodent Control (Deratization)</strong> — complete elimination of mice and rats in residential and industrial properties.</span></li>
            <li><span><strong>Fumigation</strong> — professional treatment of grain, crops, and agricultural storage facilities.</span></li>
            <li><span><strong>Disinfection</strong> — eradication of pathogenic viruses, bacteria, mold, and fungal spores.</span></li>
            <li><span><strong>Deodorization</strong> — neutralising persistent unpleasant odors in premises and commercial vehicles.</span></li>
          </ul>

          <p class="mb-6">
            Our comprehensive approach not only eradicates existing infestations quickly and safely, but also provides lasting preventative recommendations to ensure long-term protection.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-8">
            Cucaracha technicians undergo certified annual training in modern pesticides, insecticides, and safety standards, continually honing their expertise to guarantee top-tier service.
          </p>

          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mt-12 mb-12">
            <div>
              <h2 class="text-2xl mb-6">Facilities We Service:</h2>
              <ul class="space-y-3">
                <li>Apartments and private residences;</li>
                <li>Food processing and restaurant facilities;</li>
                <li>Warehouses and distribution hubs;</li>
                <li>Basements and technical sub-levels;</li>
                <li>Hotels, hostels, and recreational venues;</li>
                <li>Schools, kindergartens, and medical clinics;</li>
                <li>Multi-family buildings and common areas;</li>
                <li>Commercial and corporate real estate.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h2 class="text-2xl mb-6">Our Guarantees to Clients:</h2>
              <ol class="space-y-4 list-decimal list-inside marker:text-[var(--color-accent-primary)] marker:font-bold">
                <li>Full discretion and anonymity at the client’s request;</li>
                <li>Guaranteed high quality verified by formal service agreements;</li>
                <li>Free initial audit and consultation upon request;</li>
                <li>Round-the-clock 24/7 service availability;</li>
                <li>Complete client support throughout every step of cooperation.</li>
              </ol>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-[rgba(115,96,242,0.05)] border border-[var(--color-accent-primary)]/20 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl mb-12 relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute -right-6 -top-6 text-[var(--color-accent-primary)]/10">
              <svg class="w-32 h-32" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10h-9.983zm-14.017 0v-7.391c0-5.704 3.748-9.57 9-10.609l.996 2.151c-2.433.917-3.996 3.638-3.996 5.849h3.983v10h-9.983z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl mb-4 relative z-10">Why Clients Recommend Us:</h2>
            <p class="italic text-lg relative z-10">
              "Along with in-depth and responsive consultations, I received uncompromising quality and immediate extermination results."
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 relative z-10">
              — Because for us there are no minor details. True professionalism begins with attention to every single detail. We strive to make every interaction seamless, transparent, and completely effective!
            </p>
          </div>

          <h2 class="text-2xl mt-12 mb-6">Our Capacity & Technical Equipment</h2>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-5 gap-3 md:gap-4 mb-8">
            <div class="bg-white/50 border border-white p-4 rounded-2xl text-center shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-center">
              <div class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-[var(--color-accent-primary)] mb-1">45</div>
              <div class="text-[10px] md:text-xs font-medium leading-tight break-words">Full-time<br/>Staff Members</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white/50 border border-white p-4 rounded-2xl text-center shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-center">
              <div class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-[var(--color-accent-primary)] mb-1">34</div>
              <div class="text-[10px] md:text-xs font-medium leading-tight break-words">Certified<br/>Exterminators</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white/50 border border-white p-4 rounded-2xl text-center shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-center">
              <div class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-[var(--color-accent-primary)] mb-1">24/7</div>
              <div class="text-[10px] md:text-xs font-medium leading-tight break-words">Working<br/>Schedule</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white/50 border border-white p-4 rounded-2xl text-center shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-center">
              <div class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-[var(--color-accent-primary)] mb-1">130-240</div>
              <div class="text-[10px] md:text-xs font-medium leading-tight break-words">Inquiries<br/>Daily</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white/50 border border-white p-4 rounded-2xl text-center shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-center">
              <div class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-[var(--color-accent-primary)] mb-1">4-8</div>
              <div class="text-[10px] md:text-xs font-medium leading-tight break-words">Orders/Day<br/>Per Technician</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white/50 border border-white p-4 rounded-2xl text-center shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-center">
              <div class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-[var(--color-accent-primary)] mb-1">30</div>
              <div class="text-[10px] md:text-xs font-medium leading-tight break-words">Cold Fog<br/>Generators</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white/50 border border-white p-4 rounded-2xl text-center shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-center">
              <div class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-[var(--color-accent-primary)] mb-1">4</div>
              <div class="text-[10px] md:text-xs font-medium leading-tight break-words">Thermal Fog<br/>Units</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white/50 border border-white p-4 rounded-2xl text-center shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-center">
              <div class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-[var(--color-accent-primary)] mb-1">20</div>
              <div class="text-[10px] md:text-xs font-medium leading-tight break-words">Manual Pressure<br/>Sprayers</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white/50 border border-white p-4 rounded-2xl text-center shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-center">
              <div class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-[var(--color-accent-primary)] mb-1">2</div>
              <div class="text-[10px] md:text-xs font-medium leading-tight break-words">Motorized<br/>Sprayers</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white/50 border border-white p-4 rounded-2xl text-center shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-center">
              <div class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-[var(--color-accent-primary)] mb-1">15</div>
              <div class="text-[10px] md:text-xs font-medium leading-tight break-words">Service<br/>Vehicles</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h2 class="text-2xl mt-12 mb-6">State-of-the-Art Professional Equipment:</h2>
          <p class="italic text-lg mb-6">
            All equipment in our arsenal is regularly serviced and calibrated to achieve maximum operating performance and precision mist dispersion.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-4 mb-8">
            <li><span><strong>Cold Fog ULV Generators</strong> powered by high-output Samsung motors — VectorFog C150 & VectorFog C150 Plus.</span></li>
            <li><span><strong>Professional Sprayers</strong> SR 430 STIHL 4244 011 2600.</span></li>
            <li><span><strong>Industrial Air Ozonator</strong> "Ozone-20".</span></li>
            <li><span><strong>Thermal Aerosol Generator</strong> Longray TS-35A Euro.</span></li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="text-2xl mt-12 mb-6">Our Scientific & Practical Methods:</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-4 mb-8">
            <li><span>Targeted chemical treatments;</span></li>
            <li><span>Thermal misting treatments;</span></li>
            <li><span>Microencapsulated dust and gel baits;</span></li>
            <li><span>Perimeter barrier defense techniques.</span></li>
          </ul>

          <div class="bg-white/50 border border-[var(--color-accent-primary)]/20 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl mb-8 relative overflow-hidden">
            <p class="font-bold text-xl text-[var(--color-text-main)] relative z-10 leading-relaxed">
              Backed by nearly a decade of continuous field practice and laboratory formulation updates, we select the exact products and concentrations for each unique case. That is how we deliver 100% positive extermination results to thousands of clients who have trusted us since 2015!
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  
  <ConsultationForm />
  <Footer />
</Layout>
